drvIntel82596 is a source reconstruction of Apple's i386 Intel82596NetworkDriver
binary. Its C and Objective-C implementations were written from IDA and Binrecon
analysis of the reference binary; original source code was not available. The
reference binary and its embedded resources are not included in this package.

The adapter tables, localized strings, and DriverHelp resources are reproduced
from the supplied Intel82596NetworkDriver configuration bundle. Their original
notices and attributions, if any, are preserved in the resource files.
